{"title":"Disposable Vapes","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover our range of single-use disposable vape devices, pre-filled with incredible flavors from top brands like Elf Bar, Nasty, Yuoto, Iget, and more. Perfect for transitioning smokers or vapers who are always on the move, these devices require no charging or refilling. With convenient draw activation, it’s as simple as grab, vape, and enjoy! Explore our collection and shop the best disposable vape devices online in Kenya today!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"elfbar-raya-d1-13000-puffs","title":"Elfbar Raya D1 (13000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eElf Bar Raya D1 with 13000 puffs boast an impressive puff capacity, this device delivers a long-lasting and flavorful journey with its innovative technology. Elfbar 13000 ensures a hassle-free and convenient vaping solution. Raya D1 Elf Bar provides a refreshing and enjoyable taste profile. Ideal for users seeking a high-puff disposable option, the Elfbar D1 Raya promises an immersive vaping session with every draw.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFlavour name tells how and what flavour is! Shop with most variety of flavours only at [YOUR BRAND]!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecification:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuff: 13000 Puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine: 5%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCapacity: 18ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: 650mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Rechargeable with Type C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ELF BAR","offers":[{"title":"Double Mango","offer_id":42088213184567,"sku":"E B R D1 (13K P) - Double Mango","price":1800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Kiwi Guava Grape","offer_id":41580355584055,"sku":"E B R D1 (13K P) - Kiwi Guava Grape","price":1800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ribena Lychee","offer_id":42145722368055,"sku":"E B R D1 (13K P) - R