ction, Overheat protection, Over time vaping protection), all designed in the chips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSalt Nicotine: 5%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1200mah\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-liquid Capacity: 5.0ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuffs: ˜2500 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Yuoto","offers":[{"title":"Energy Drink Ice","offer_id":41712871931959,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Energy Drink Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Passion Fruit","offer_id":41712871964727,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Passion Fruit","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Popcorn","offer_id":41801823158327,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Popcorn","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mango Ice","offer_id":41712871997495,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Mango Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mint Ice","offer_id":41712872030263,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Mint Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Coke Ice","offer_id":41712871899191,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Coke Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blueberry Ice","offer_id":41712872063031,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Blueberry Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Watermelon Ice","offer_id":41712872095799,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Watermelon Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Grape Ice","offer_id":41712872128567,"sku":"Y XXL V (2.5K P) - Grape Ice","price":700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/yuoto-xxl-disposable-vape-2500puffs.jpg?v=1750131413"},{"product_id":"yuoto-xxl-max","title":"Yuoto XXL MAX Vape (3500 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMain Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1. Lightweight and portable\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e2. The battery pack has more than 50% higher durability than similar products, reaching an amazing 3500 puffs.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e3. No button, automatic smoking\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e4. Natural plant and fruit extracts reduce taste\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e5. More protection system(Low voltage cut off mode, Short circuit protection, Overheat protection, Over time vaping protection), all designed in the chips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSalt Nicotine: 5%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1200mah\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-liquid Capacity: 9.0ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuffs: ˜3500 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Yuoto","offers":[{"title":"Watermelon Ice","offer_id":41712920920119,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Watermelon Ice","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Energy Drink Ice","offer_id":41712916561975,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Energy Drink Ice","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Berry Bubble Ice","offer_id":41712916529207,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Berry Bubble Ice","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Watermelon","offer_id":41712916398135,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Strawberry Watermelon","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Grape Ice","offer_id":41712916430903,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Grape Ice","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blueberry Ice","offer_id":41712916463671,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Blueberry Ice","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mint Ice","offer_id":41712916496439,"sku":"Y XXL Max V (3.5K P) - Mint Ice","price":995.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Yuoto-XXL-MAX-vape-flavour-list.jpg?v=1750132149"},{"product_id":"priv-bar-turbo-vape-15000-puffs","title":"Priv Bar Turbo Vape (15000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome the future of vaping with Priv Bar by the renowned and trusted brand, SMOK. This cutting-edge device features an industry-standard screen, providing a clear display of your vapor levels and battery life. Tailor your vaping experience with the adjustable airflow, offering a range from 10,000 to 15,000 puffs. Elevate your satisfaction with the new standard in vaping technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlavour Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlaskan Mint = Menthol flavour;\u003cbr\u003eHonolulu Blue = Sweet Blue Razz flavour;\u003cbr\u003eTropical Lime Blast = Sweet Lime flavour;\u003cbr\u003eFlorida Lemonade = Sweet Lemon flavour;\u003cbr\u003eDr. Cherry = Cherry + Cola flavour;\u003cbr\u003eWatermelon Chill = Watermelon Ice;\u003cbr\u003eBlackberry Peach Lemon = Sweet Berry flavour; and \u003cbr\u003eStrawberry Mint Candy = Strawberry Bubble gum flavour. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-liquid contents: 16ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Level: 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuffs per Device: 10000 (Turbo Mode)\/15000\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: 800mAh (Rechargeable via USB-C)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurbo Mode: Increased Wattage for bigger flavor and puff\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Screen: Battery, e-Juice, and Power Mode Indicators\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IGET","offers":[{"title":"Blackberry Peach Lemon","offer_id":41713027842103,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Blackberry Peach Lemon","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Dr. Cherry","offer_id":41713027907639,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Dr.Cherry","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Bluerazz Lemon","offer_id":41713027973175,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Bluerazz Lemon","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Honolulu Blue","offer_id":41713028005943,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Honolulu Blue","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Watermelon Chill","offer_id":41713027874871,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Watermelon Chill","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Alaskan Mint","offer_id":41713027776567,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Alaskan Mint","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Mint Candy","offer_id":41713027809335,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Strawberry Mint Candy","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Florida Lemonade","offer_id":41713027940407,"sku":"Priv B T V (15K P) - Florida Lemonade","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smoktech-priv-bar-turbo-15000-puffs.jpg?v=1750134339"},{"product_id":"vhill-snap-8k-vape","title":"Vhill Snap 8K Vape (8000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the next level of vaping with the Vhill Snap 8000 Puffs Disposable Vape. This cool device is perfect for anyone who wants great performance and style without any hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8000 Puffs: Enjoy up to 8000 puffs, giving you a long-lasting vaping experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRechargeable Battery: You can recharge the battery, so you don’t have to worry about it running out before you finish all the puffs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart LED Screen: The handy LED screen shows important info like how much battery is left and how many puffs you’ve taken. It’s easy to use and keeps you informed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComfortable Design: The Vhill Snap is designed to fit nicely in your hand, making it comfortable to use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vhill","offers":[{"title":"Peach Blueberry","offer_id":41762424651831,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Peach Blueberry","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Peach Mango Watermelon","offer_id":41763519266871,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Peach Mango Watermelon","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Ice","offer_id":41763519299639,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Strawberry Ice","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mint Ice","offer_id":41763519332407,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Mint Ice","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Miami Mint","offer_id":41763519365175,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Miami Mint","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Raspberry Ice","offer_id":41763519397943,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Strawberry Raspberry Ice","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"California Cherry","offer_id":41763519430711,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - California Cherry","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Watermelon Ice","offer_id":41763519463479,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Watermelon Ice","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Ice","offer_id":41763519496247,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Black Ice","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cool Mint","offer_id":41763519529015,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Cool Mint","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Razz Ice","offer_id":41763519561783,"sku":"Vhill S 8K V (8K P) - Blue Razz Ice","price":750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vhill-snap-8k-disposable_vape.webp?v=1751923551"},{"product_id":"funky-lands-ci5000-vape","title":"Funky Lands Ci5000 Vape (5000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the ultimate in disposable vaping with the Funky Lands Ci5000, powered by advanced QUAQ Coil Technology. With a massive 10ml e-liquid capacity and 40mg nicotine strength, it delivers smooth, flavorful, and satisfying hits with every puff. Enjoy up to 5000 puffs of bold fruit blends, sweet notes, or classic tobacco flavors — perfect for both beginners and experienced vapers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrefilled Capacity: 10ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 650mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 4% (40mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuff Count: 5000\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Funky Lands","offers":[{"title":"Mango Gami","offer_id":41763613376567,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Mango Gami","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Berry Peach Blossom","offer_id":41763613278263,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Berry Peach Blossom","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Triple Berry Ice","offer_id":41990947143735,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Triple Berry","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mountain Ice","offer_id":41763613245495,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Mountain Ice","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Razz Ice","offer_id":41763613311031,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Blue Razz Ice","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Miami Mint","offer_id":41763613343799,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Miami Mint","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Berry Mix","offer_id":41763613409335,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Berry Mix","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Triple Berry","offer_id":41763613212727,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Triple Berry","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Ice","offer_id":41763549118519,"sku":"F L Ci5K V (5K P) - Strawberry Ice","price":800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Funky-Lands-Ci5000-Disposable-Vape.webp?v=1751927476"},{"product_id":"elfbar-pi9000-9000-puffs","title":"Elfbar Pi9000 (9000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor vapers looking for a beginner vaping device you're at right place, the Elf Bar Pi9000 disposable vape is a fantastic choice. It’s ideal for vaping when on the go due to its pre-filled e-liquid and simple design. It has a really unique shape that resembles a \u003cem\u003epillow\u003c\/em\u003e. Since e-liquid’s physical and chemical effects are as soft and gentle as a pillow, you don’t need to worry about the flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil : Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuff : 9000 Puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume : 18ML Flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength : 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Liquid \u0026amp; Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging : Rechargeable with Type C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou may also have a look at \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/elfbar-vapes\" title=\"Elfbar latest models\"\u003eElfbar's latest models\u003c\/a\u003e here.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ELF BAR","offers":[{"title":"Raspberry Passion Fruit Orange","offer_id":41807608414263,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Raspberry Passion Fruit Orange","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pomegranate Berry","offer_id":41807608479799,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Pomegranate Berry","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Razz Ice","offer_id":41807608512567,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Blue Razz Ice",