-2 10000 Puffs, a sleek and high-performing disposable vape designed for long-lasting enjoyment. Boasting an impressive 10k puff capacity, this device features an 18ml e-liquid tank and 5% salt nicotine, delivering rich flavors and smooth hits in every puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eAvailable in irresistible flavors, including Watermelon Ice, Blueberry Lime, and Double Apple, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eYuoto\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e vape Thanos-2 caters to every preference. Whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned vaper, this device is perfect for enjoying extended vaping without the hassle of refilling or frequent recharges.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eYuoto\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e Thanos Vape- 2 10000 Puffs Specifications:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003ePuff Capacity: +10,000 puffs\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eBattery: 500mAh rechargeable\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eE-liquid Volume: 18ml\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eNicotine Content: 5% salt nicotine\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Yuoto","offers":[{"title":"Strawberry Watermelon Ice","offer_id":41838482194487,"sku":"Y Thano2 V (10K P) - Strawberry Watermelon Ice","price":1790.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Grape Ice","offer_id":41838482227255,"sku":"Y Thano2 V (10K P) - Grape Ice","price":1790.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blueberry Ice","offer_id":41838482260023,"sku":"Y Thano2 V (10K P) - Blueberry Ice"