ce elevated by a refreshing icy surge.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRuby Delight – Juicy watermelon blended with a crisp, cooling sensation.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlue Laffi Taffi – Smooth blueberry taffy wrapped in a creamy, dessert-like experience.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCaribbean Nights – A vibrant fusion of mango, peach, and watermelon.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCran Citrus – A tangy trio of cranberry, pineapple, and zesty orange.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIsland Punch – Deep red cherry and bright citrus for a bold, fruity punch.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRed \u0026amp; Green Fusion – Crisp red apple meets tart green apple for a balanced bite.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpeedy Beast – A smooth yet tangy mix of ripe watermelon and tart raspberry.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eINCLUDES:\u003cbr\u003e1 x Kangvape Speedy Beast X 60K Disposable\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Kangvape","offers":[{"title":"Blue Laffi Taffi","offer_id":42110533664823,"sku":"KangV Speedy Beast X (60K P) - Blue Laffi Taffi","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Caribbean Nights","offer_id":42110533697591,"sku":"KangV Speedy Beast X (60K P) - Caribbean Nights","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cran Citrus","offer_id":42110533730359,"sku":"KangV Speedy Beast X (60K P) - Cran Citrus","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Miami Mint","offer_id":42110533795895,"sku":"KangV Speedy Beast X (60K P) - Miami Mint","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Peach O Rings","offer_id":42110533828663,"sku":"KangV Speedy Beast X (60K P) - Peach O Rings","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ruby Delight","offer_id":42110533894199,"sku":"KangV Speedy Beast X (60K P) - Ruby Delight","price":2650.0,"currenc