bo (25000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eELF BAR COMBO 25000 delivers a powerful disposable vape experience with up to 25,000 puffs, triple-flavor design, and dual modes for customizable performance. Easily switch between single flavors or enjoy a unique blended mode using the combo switch, while dual airflow ensures a smooth, satisfying draw every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: 850mAh rechargeable (Type-C)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-liquid: 22ml pre-filled\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 5%\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuffs: Up to 25,000\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual airflow system\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery \u0026amp; e-liquid display screen\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLite Mode: 15W (up to 25,000 puffs)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurbo Mode: 35W (up to 15,000 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ELF BAR","offers":[{"title":"Strawberry + Watermelon Bubblegum","offer_id":42114934603831,"sku":"E B Combo (25K P) - Strawberry + Watermelon Bubblegum","price":2550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grape + Blackcurrant","offer_id":42114934669367,"sku":"E B Combo (25K P) - Grape + Blackcurrant","price":2550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Peach Mango + Watermelon","offer_id":42114934702135,"sku":"E B Combo (25K P) - Peach Mango + Watermelon","price":2550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Peach + Mango","offer_id":42114934734903,"sku":"E B Combo (25K P) - Peach + Mango","price":2550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cherry + Cola","offer_id":42115053846583,"sku":"E B Combo (25K P) - Cherry + Cola","price":2550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Grape + Grape","offer_id":42115054010423,"sku":"E B Combo (25K P) - Green Grape + Grape